  "subject": "🤖 AI Agents Daily — The $500 Billion Rate Shopper in Your Customer's Pocket | October 7, 2026",
  "htmlBody": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\" />\n  <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n  <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n  <!--<![endif]-->\n  <title>🤖 AI Agents Daily — The $500 Billion Rate Shopper in Your Customer's Pocket | October 7, 2026</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f0f0f0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ OUTER WRAPPER -->\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f0f0f0\"\n       style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:24px 10px;\">\n\n      <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n      <table width=\"680\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr><td>\n      <![endif]-->\n\n      <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ MAIN CONTAINER -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n             style=\"max-width:680px;border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── HEADER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n              style=\"padding:40px 30px 28px 30px;border-bottom:2px solid #009c6d;\">\n\n            <!-- Logo emoji -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:40px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:12px;\">🤖</div>\n\n            <!-- Publication title -->\n            <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\n                        line-height:1.2;\">\n              AI Agents Daily\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Tagline -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:14px;color:#666666;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;\">\n              AI developments that matter for financial institutions\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Date -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#999999;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">\n              October 7, 2026\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ──────────────────────────────────────── DEEP DIVE SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:40px 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Deep Dive 🔍\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article title -->\n            <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;line-height:1.4;\">\n              The $500 Billion Rate Shopper in Your Customer's Pocket\n            </h3>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article body (HTML from Claude, inline-styled by email-builder) -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n              <h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Overview</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">Deposit inertia is banking's oldest free lunch — and AI agents are about to eat it. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxQc01iQU13b0hoV1BpcnRUYW1qWUs2NVhTM3RxM0VDT24yNFpZMHhtZXVEZU1kWm16OUVMY3ZPTWZxOXY1Z3RnUWl4SFpMYXlkWkNiT2ppX3dZdEQ2VVhERjlYWTVaYzVFcHRiTEFJZ2ItdE9zSGoyd3RWUUVEQzZhdFJRV3U?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:none;\">Financial Times reports</a> that autonomous AI agents hunting for better savings rates could redirect <strong>$500 billion</strong> away from incumbent banks — a structural threat to the deposit franchises that anchor retail and commercial bank profitability.</p><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">The Details</h3><ul style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0 0 0 20px;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">AI agents can continuously scan and compare savings rates across institutions, acting on behalf of depositors in real time, 24/7</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">The $500bn figure represents the estimated deposit outflow from incumbent banks as rate-seeking agents route balances to higher-yield alternatives</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Banks have historically benefited from depositor inertia — customers rarely switched accounts despite meaningful rate differentials</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">AI agents eliminate that inertia entirely: no friction, no forgotten logins, no hesitation</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Neobanks, money-market funds, and high-yield savings accounts stand to be the primary beneficiaries</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Net interest margins — already under pressure — face a new structural headwind as AI-driven rate competition intensifies</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Why It Matters</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">For retail and commercial banks, the passive deposit base has been a structural advantage for decades. Customers left money sitting in low-yield accounts not by choice but by inertia. AI agents remove that advantage entirely — they will compare, move, and reallocate balances automatically, at a scale no human financial advisor ever could. Banks that can't compete on rates must compete on something else: relationship, advice, or features a rival agent cannot replicate.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">The timeline is shorter than most boards realize. Personal AI agents are already mainstream — Meta Muse, the emerging Personal Agent Protocol, and Apple Intelligence are all converging on this exact use case. Banks should be running deposit outflow stress tests now, identifying which customer segments are most at risk, and asking the harder question: what would make a customer's AI agent choose to stay?</p>\n            </div>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Deep Dive → Things to Know -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── THINGS TO KNOW SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Things to Know 👀\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Things to Know entries injected by email-builder -->\n            \n      <!-- TTK entry 1 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            1. <strong>Redesigning the Financial Crime Operating Model for the Agentic Era</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQNG9uLXA1aURjT1E1ZVczRmplREZWXzJyWXIzSmlGRGNWNncyMXZVSlhPVlh5RWZYa3FubnRwcllzLXhWOFM0RUJUalBfV011MHdsNDUxREdrcGFhWHNFbmhUZGJrQ2VYbktYMzJFZ1o1OW9xd2dzaWZ3a0NDVUJiTG1leS1TVWx1cGpETmhpS3IzNUwzbm53dDJDVm1xNTVlbEdfN3h3bmhTdw?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">American Banker</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Banks are rethinking financial crime operations as agentic AI reshapes both the threat landscape and response capabilities. Moving from rule-based to AI-native detection requires new operating models, governance frameworks, and talent structures.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Compliance infrastructure must evolve.</strong> As AI agents execute transactions autonomously, financial crime teams need AI-native detection systems that match the speed and scale of automated threats — not just legacy rule engines.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 2 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            2. <strong>Incognia Launches AI Agent Detection to Secure Autonomous Financial Transactions</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOaXZncU9nbmx2OGlvRkoyMnNWRl83US1GaVFSeUpKUGxmUm51X0ZEa283SVpFemJxLU1TZk4xTlVHS2RCeTd6RjdlbGdjSTk2cTExU01DVUwtMkhIc2NBMGk5eDBhSFo3OHZZdHplemJBa2xSRHlJU0dQc3VDWUtXNzZjV2l2a0ZYSzYxNE1QSlNfT21iN1VlOEQ2dUU?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">FF News</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Incognia launched an AI agent detection capability for financial services that identifies whether a transaction was initiated by an autonomous AI agent or a human — enabling institutions to verify agent identity and authorization before processing.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>A new identity layer for agentic transactions.</strong> Banks will need tools to distinguish human from AI-agent-initiated transactions — Incognia's launch signals a fast-growing security market around autonomous financial transaction verification.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 3 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            3. <strong>Anthropic releases Claude Haiku 5.5 small model and halves Sonnet 5.5 cache read prices</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNV0pNOFU1Vk9OTXVjSnhQY1hqUWtIWGZSbWYtTUFTRTRhcE9qYUlaNklFbkdfaXBvVFllbnhFUHNSZVFvazFEMkdSOVYyR2toa3RuNC1tMjR2WWNSSHVmZGhxay1kbnlqZU50cUxxSDlMbjdFV1Q0NG1oMWZNVEQ5SW1Xcnp6a2R6UW1kQkUxU1E1UFAtRnRMTzhieFo4bUprNERRckpneXJ4ZUY0bklRUm9xSmtPNWJMV3g1bnY5WUk1QQ?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">SiliconANGLE</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Anthropic launched Claude Haiku 5.5, its cheapest and fastest small model yet, while simultaneously cutting Sonnet 5.5 prompt cache read prices by 50%. The dual move meaningfully lowers the cost of deploying AI at production scale.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Cheaper AI lowers the barrier for financial deployment.</strong> Falling model costs make it economically viable for banks to run AI at higher volumes — across customer service, document processing, compliance, and real-time decisioning.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 4 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            4. <strong>Docomo Business and IBM Japan to Collaborate on Safety Measures for Autonomous AI, Targeting Commercialization in Finance and Healthcare by FY2026</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE1BdjRzcnIwRVFsTGlIdGtxdGp2WTZrY3pJbVF4VHdxQ1BMWFZzck8tYmJCb0pyVjNUbUotbnpXNFFMUi1BbDF1RGJ5OUt4dHpKeXl1THQ2VV9oTVoxazJMQnV3UXN2OXo0UzJHWjdNelAxdTdyQXc?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">BigGo Finance</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Docomo Business and IBM Japan announced a collaboration on safety frameworks for autonomous AI, targeting commercial deployment in financial services and healthcare by fiscal year 2026.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Enterprise governance is being productized.</strong> Major players building AI safety infrastructure signals that institutional-grade oversight frameworks are becoming commercially available — a prerequisite for regulatory approval of autonomous AI in finance.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 5 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            5. <strong>OpenAI releases progress on more than 300 math research problems, stunning humans</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQUU1YaVNmSXhlYVF0XzBLM0JBY1pJZFA0MGQ5YVJzZ19Cd3V0ZWx1Q0dlZmY0MFVNNk9BSG44ZGFPb1B6UUR6OFZrZGM2NHhmU285aG1zdnVVSnNnR3BsNnBLMTR2NnFFZ2RnYmdiX2I5NGZUanJYVUlxOHVpYlZrakR4VkE3WTR1ekVleHBwOWpFR29rT250TUlZalpYaW5HV2ZaSmRxb2tUbHV2bkVlYzFjenk3dw?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">The Washington Post</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            OpenAI published results showing significant progress on over 300 frontier mathematical research problems — performance that stunned human researchers and marks a new milestone in AI reasoning capability.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Advanced math reasoning has direct financial applications.</strong> Breakthroughs in formal mathematical reasoning translate to quantitative finance, derivatives pricing, and risk modeling — capabilities that will matter to trading desks and quant teams at major institutions.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 6 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            6. <strong>Agentic AI in financial services: How banks are rethinking lending, risk and decision-making</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">The Economic Times</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Banks are actively piloting agentic AI to automate credit underwriting, risk assessment, and financial decision-making, with early adopters reporting faster cycle times and more consistent risk evaluation.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Core banking processes are being automated now.</strong> Lenders moving to AI-assisted underwriting gain speed and consistency advantages — institutions not investing in this capability today risk structural disadvantage against faster-moving peers.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Spacer after last entry -->\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:4px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Things to K